  "question": {
    "text": "From a point <math><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo></math> two tangents <math><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></math> and <math><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></math> are drawn to the hyperbola <math><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>. If the product of the slopes of these tangents is <math><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the locus of <math><mi>P</mi></math> is a conic whose eccentricity is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
